  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Response to the urgent needs of vulnerable food insecure people in Kordofan and Darfur regions through provision of emergency agriculture support to enhance stable crop production and improve access to food.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide transport and logistics support for seeds delivery and distribution in Kordofan and Darfur regions. Specifically, the project will cover increased seeds transport cost to the three Kordofan states (North, West and South) and three states in Darfur (North, East and South)</narrative>
  </description>
